  "prefLabel": "He-W 654.08 Provided Shelter",
  "priorExpiration": "1997-10-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 654.08 Provided Shelter. Shelter that is either provided at no charge to the AG or is paid by an individual, agency, organization, or governmental unit outside of the AG, shall not be assigned a dollar value or be counted as income.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #6531, INTERIM, eff 6-27-97, EXPIRES: 10-25-97; ss by #6614, eff 10-24-97; ss by #8452, eff 10-22-05; ss by #10471, eff 11-26-13; ss by #13715, eff 8-8-23",
